window.products.push({"id":1176031,"name":"SwiftFinder Keys Finder, Bluetooth Tracker and Item Locator for Keys, Bags, Wallets, Pet and More; Water Resistance with 1 Year Replaceable Battery, i","category":"electronics","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PfcwmfTWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WHY CHOOSE US? - With 1/3 of the cost, you can get the same quality product here! This key locator is provided along with a completely turnkey experience POWERFUL FINDER- Attach the ST02 Pro to items such as keys, bags, wallets, luggage, and even pets, then track them using our free App (iOS and Android Compatible) FIND IN THE NEARBY - Use our free app to ring your key tracker or let your smart devices find it. NOTE: Customizable ringtones FIND YOUR PHONE - Even if the phone is in silent mode, just double press the button on the key finder locator and the phone will ring SEPARATION ALERTS - When the phone finder is out of range, your phone will ring to remind you might leave something behind LOCATION RECORD - You can view recent locations on a map through the app, helping you find items that are not in Bluetooth range CONTACT YOU VIA QR CODE - When the item is lost, the person who finds the item can scan the QR code to get the contact information you have reserved SHARE WITH OTHERS - With the free app, wallet tracker can also be connected to multiple phones so that others can know the detailed location info of the item IOS & ANDROID, SMART DEVICES AVAILABLE - The APP is available for both IOS and Android, and you can also use Siri, Alexa, and Google Assistant to ring your finder Replaceable battery. water resistant. free app. Bluetooth range: 100-300ft (outdoor unobstructed), 30-100ft (indoor obscured)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PfcwmfTWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SwiftFinder","source_asin":"B0BWMTG7M9","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1176031","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWMTG7M9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWMTG7M9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1176032,"name":"Belkin MIXIT PureAV 002 Headphones with Built-in Microphone (Blue) Blue","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vPhnmvcwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Belkin PureAV 002 headphones, with microphone, are the perfect complement to your mobile device, designed to deliver the great audio your video has been missing. Movies, TV shows, web content and games all come alive with the sound as it was meant to be experienced. Your mobile device delivers fantastic video, and the accompanying audio is also superb-but that small speaker just can't do it justice. The PureAV 002 headphones are designed to bring out all that great audio, completing your mobile video experience. Belkin PureAV 002 headphones have a built in Mic and Multifunction Remote compatible with most Android, Blackberry, and iOS (iPad and iPhone) products. You have one touch control for phone calls, and playing music is convenient and easy. Comfortable fit is critical for best performance. PureAV headphones all come with a selection of three silicon soft tips assuring you comfortable long term use. From the Manufacturer Get the most out of your favorite music, movies, games, and TV shows wherever you go with the Belkin MiXiT UP PureAV 002 Headphones. These colorful headphones let you enjoy a wide, dynamic range of sound on your mobile device for an immersive audio experience. A built-in microphone lets you take hands-free calls, a multi-function remote provides quick and convenient control over your music playlist, and three sizes of soft tips provide extended comfort. A colorful, lightweight companion to your mobile device. View larger . Control your music playlist with the built-in multi-function remote. View larger . Exceptional Audio for Music, Movies, Games, and More Even if your smartphone or tablet delivers exceptional video playback, its single speaker simply can't match that quality with equally powerful audio. With the Belkin MiXiT UP PureAV 002 headphones, movie and video game sound effects will seem more real and exciting, and you won't have to struggle to hear dialogue. And because the in-ear headphones provide dynamic sound in a lightweight package, they are ideal for listening to music on the go. Inline Control of Your Music Playlist An included multi-function remote control--compatible with most Android, Blackberry, and iOS (iPad and iPhone) products--gives you convenient one-touch control over your music playlist and other mobile device functions. The headphones also feature a built-in mic that allows you to take hands-free calls. Includes Three Sizes of Soft Tips for Extended Comfort These headphones come with three sizes of soft, flexible silicone tips, so you can watch an entire movie in comfort. These tips are durable for long-term use, and they stay in place to keep sound where it belongs so you won't have to worry about disturbing anyone nearby. Available in Different Colors Part of Belkin's MiXiT UP series, the Belkin PureAV 002 headphones come in a range of bright, attention-grabbing hues. Choose from black , green , blue , purple , red , and pink . What's in the Box MiXiT UP PureAV 002 headphones and three pairs of silicone tips. MiXiT UP PureAV 002 Headphones At a Glance: Fully immersive audio for mobile video Fully immersive audio for mobile video Wide, dynamic range of sound for music Wide, dynamic range of sound for music Built-in mic for hands-free calls Built-in mic for hands-free calls Remote gives you control over all device functions Remote gives you control over all device functions Soft, flexible silicone tips for extended comfort Soft, flexible silicone tips for extended comfort Available in six different colors Available in six different colors Part of Belkin's MiXiT UP series--choose from six bright hues. View larger .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vPhnmvcwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Belkin","source_asin":"B00EPAVNKM","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1176032","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00EPAVNKM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00EPAVNKM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
