window.products.push({"id":1176040,"name":"1MORE ComfoBuds Mini Hybrid Active Noise Cancelling Earbuds, in-Ear Headphones with Stereo Sound, Bluetooth 5.2 Headset with 4 Mics, Clear Calls, Wire","category":"electronics","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31nWvHByVWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"True Quiet in a Small Package: We put 1MORE’s proprietary QuietMax active noise cancellation technology into the compact body of the ComfoBuds Mini to provide true quiet. With up to 40dB noise cancellation depth, you can get a more immersive listening experience. And the earbuds allow you to switch between multiple listening modes to fit different scenarios. Smaller Size, Increased Comfort: The ComfoBuds Mini is the world’s smallest and lightest ANC earbuds. A single earbud weighs only 3.7g, and with the extra tiny size and ergonomic design, you’ll get an “invisible” but super comfortable wearing experience. Four sizes of silicone ear tips are provided to get the perfect fit for your ear and better audio performance. Tiny Mics, Crystal-Clear Calls: Two mics hidden in the tiny body of earbud work together to filter out background noise, then accurately pick up your voice and amplify it, keeping your voice sounding clear, even when calling in a carnival parade. Astounding Audio Performance: Tiny in size, but no compromise on sound quality. A 7mm dynamic driver produces a rich, powerful, authentic sound that is usually reserved for big bulky headphones. And the integration of SoundID technology allows you to get your perfect sound that fits your ears and preference. Convenient Wireless Charging: The ComfoBuds Mini TWS earbuds can power up super easily on the go with Qi-compatible wireless charging, say goodbye to tangled cables.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31nWvHByVWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"1MORE","source_asin":"B09Q376C6Z","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1176040","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q376C6Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q376C6Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
