window.products.push({"id":1176244,"name":"Sangean DT-800YL AM / FM / NOAA Weather Alert / Rechargeable / Alarm Clock / 45 Pre-Sets / Pocket Radio (Renewed)","category":"electronics","retail price":43.03,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HXUWILSfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NOAA Weather Alert Emergency Channel The NOAA Weather Alert Emergency Channel plays a very loud tone when an extreme weather condition is imminent, a police emergency or child abduction has occurred, or any type of public awareness becomes critical. Sensitivity and Selectivity Sensitivity and selectivity of the DT-800 is remarkable and comparable to many standalone AM/FM table-top radios. Advanced Digital Receiver provides drift free AM/FM reception and the 45 preset (20 AM, 20 FM, 5WX) selections let you mix AM/FM stations with immediate access through the \"Page\" button. Dynamic Bass Boost adds to your stereo musical listening pleasure. Other features include Lock Switch to prevent accidental set-up changes, adjustable auto shutoff, auto station seek, and a removable belt clip. Long Battery Life To conserve battery life the DT-800 provides an option to select when you would like the NOAA alert to be active and the LCD backlight flashes to remind you that the alert is on. In addition to emergencies, the 7 NOAA channels provide up-to-date general weather information - useful if you're planning a trip or just a picnic for the weekend. The DT-800 has a built-in battery charger allowing you to charge your batteries inside the radio.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81HXUWILSfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amazon Renewed","source_asin":"B07NDHCQXT","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1176244","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NDHCQXT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NDHCQXT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
