window.products.push({"id":1176274,"name":"Kasda AC1200 Dual Band WiFi Router, High Power Long Range Wireless Router with Gigabit Ethernet Ports, with USB2.0 / USB3.0, High Speed Wi-Fi for Home","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LceY1PhRL._AC_SL1291_.jpg","description":"About the Product: Delivering both 2.4GHz and 5GHz, concurrent bands up to 300Mbps and 900Mbps respectively, the Kasda KA1200B has a total speed of up to 1200Mbps. Featuring wireless AC technology, 5 Gigabit Ethernet ports---1 for WAN and 4 for LAN, 2 USB Host ports---1 USB2.0 and 1 USB3.0, the KA1200B is made for well-connected home. It allows you to stream video, play online games, and surf simultaneously on multiple devices with fast, stable, secure network. Key Features: * Dual Bands & Wireless 11AC The Kasda KA1200B operates over both the 2.4GHz and 5GHz bands, with the next generation of Wifi ---802.11ac, ensuring amazing wireless performance. Simultaneous Dual Band offers you the flexibility of two dedicated networks – with multiple times the bandwidth for your needs. Simple tasks like sending e-mails or web browsing can be handled by the 2.4GHz band while bandwidth intensive tasks like online gaming or HD video streaming can be processed by the 5GHz band – all at the same time. * Six Antennas With three internal antennas serving the 5GHz band and three internal antennas serving the 2.4GHz band combined with higher-quality antenna technology, you can maintain high speeds across greater distances. This provides you with incredible wireless coverage and reliability from anywhere in your large home or office. * IPv6 Supported The KA1200B supports IPv6, which is foundational to the next-generation Internet and enables a range of new services and improved user experiences. * Guest Network Guest Network Access provides secure Wi-Fi access for guests sharing your home or office network. Accessories: RJ-45 Cable x1 Installation Guide x1 US Standard Power Adapter x1","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LceY1PhRL._AC_SL1291_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kasda","source_asin":"B00T5OYY6S","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1176274","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00T5OYY6S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00T5OYY6S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
