window.products.push({"id":1176385,"name":"JBL Quicksilver In-Ear Headphones - Vibe Red/Black (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712s6KnDsdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Quiksilver Vibe JBL in-ear headphones deliver all the sonic realism and deep, distortion-free bass you'd expect from the world's leading professional audio maker with all the style you expect from the Quiksilver brand. From the Manufacturer Excitement x 2 For more than 60 years, the JBL® brand has been helping musicians sound their best for audiences large and small. Now we've teamed up with Quiksilver® sportswear to help your favorite artists sound their best for you - and you alone. Quiksilver JBL in-ear headphones deliver all the sonic realism and deep, distortion-free bass you'd expect from the world's leading professional audio maker with all the style you expect from the Quiksilver brand. Quiksilver® JBL® in-ear headphones at a glance: Available in exclusive Snow and Vibe color combinations Available in exclusive Snow and Vibe color combinations Powerful bass response Powerful bass response Ultralight weight, comfortable fit Ultralight weight, comfortable fit Dynamic, closed-back design Dynamic, closed-back design 3-button control with iPhone microphone 3-button control with iPhone microphone 99.99% oxygen-free cable, 1m 99.99% oxygen-free cable, 1m Hard silver-plated mini-jack plug and contacts Hard silver-plated mini-jack plug and contacts Carrying case included Carrying case included High-performance drivers deliver exceptional sound quality from an in-ear headphone Superior sound. Quiksilver® JBL® in-ear headphones feature high-performance drivers with an outstanding dynamic range. They deliver high-output bass response to frequencies as low as 12Hz, with the full dynamics of a live performance. Because their closed-back design will block out most ambient noise, your Quiksilver JBL headphones will transport you from wherever you are to the concert stages and professional studios where your favorite music was first recorded. A convienent inline control makes using your Apple device easy when on the go Complete Control. Quiksilver® JBL® in-ear headphones are the perfect partner for your Apple device. The inline 3 button remote allows you to seamlessly control the music on your iPod or iPhone even when they are tucked safely away. And the included microphone lets you easily take and answer calls without missing a beat when on the go. The included carrying case protects your headphones when on the go Comfort to go. We've designed the Quiksilver® JBL® in-ear headphones for comfort and performance in even the noisiest, most uncomfortable places. You'll be hard-pressed to find a set of headphones that sound better or weigh less -just 3 grams (without cable). A convenient carrying case is standard, promising that your otherwise annoying commute or airplane ride will at least be tangle-free. Built for the way you live. In keeping with our professional reputation for durability, we've designed the Quiksilver® JBL® in-ear headphones to be especially rugged, with oxygen-free cables and a hard, silver-plated jack that resists corrosion while enhancing acoustic clarity. So go ahead, drop them in your backpack, or toss them in the plastic bin at the airport checkpoint. They're built to take it. For more than 60 years, JBL has been delivering world-class listening experiences where ever great sound matters. More than 60 years of audio leadership. There's really only one goal in reproducing recorded sound: to duplicate the experience of hearing a live performance. In pursuing that goal for more than 60 years, JBL® professional loudspeakers have set - and continuously raised - the audio industry's benchmark for accuracy and realism. Today, you'll hear JBL systems virtually everywhere you hear great sound. Renowned performance spaces, major sports arenas, giant convention halls and well over half of all the world's movie theaters are powered by JBL equipment. Best-selling musicians have been relying on JBL loudspeakers in the studio and on the road since the halcyon days of the first Woodstock music festival. But JBL products aren't just for professionals. We also build exceptional entertainment systems for personal use that incorporate many of the advanced technologies, materials and manufacturing techniques originally developed for our professional systems. What's in the Box Quiksilver® JBL® in-ear headphones, carrying case Which Quiksilver® JBL® Headphone is Right for You? In-Ear Vibe On-Ear Vibe Great JBL Sound with powerful bass Ultralight Weight Design   Comfortable Fit Three button Apple remote and microphone 3-D Axis Fold Flat Design   1/4\" Headphone Adapter   Carrying Case Included","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712s6KnDsdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JBL","source_asin":"B005MI8NJK","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1176385","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B005MI8NJK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B005MI8NJK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
