window.products.push({"id":1176503,"name":"ORICO M.2 SSD NVMe Enclosure USB-C Adapter 10Gbps USB3.2 Gen2 for PCIe NVMe M-Key/M+B Key SSD (2230/2242/2260/2280), Tool-Free M2 External Case Reader","category":"electronics","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ynrj-QIbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Strong Heat Dissipation + Tool-free】The NVMe Enclosure Equipped with a cooling vest and silicone thermal pad, which are closely attached to the SSD, and accurately guide the heat to the ssd enclosure for heat dissipation, and the heat dissipation efficiency is 20% higher than that of ordinary hard disk enclosures. No tools required, easy installation, plug and play, no drivers, setup or software required. 【USB3.2 Gen2 10Gbps Speed】M.2 pcie adapter up to 10Gbps. High-speed M.2 NVME to USB 3.1 Gen2, perfect solution for data transfer and backup, the actual transfer speed depends on the speed of the SSD, the type of USB port, computer performance and NVMe media used, etc. The theoretical reading can reach 1200MB/s, and the HD movie transmission only takes 2.5 seconds. 【Universal Compatible SSD Enclosure】ORICO M.2 pcie adapter is compatible with M-Key or M+B Key's 2230 2242 2260 2280 M.2 PCIe NVME SSD, such as Samsung/Toshiba/Crucial/Kingston/Seagate/WD/Integral/PNY etc. This SSD Reader support Windows, Mac OS and Linux. SSD capacity supports up to 4TB. 【2 in 1 Data Cable】This USB data cable has 2 output ports, USB C to A and USB C to C (10Gbps), which can be switched and connected to computers, mobile phones, game consoles and other devices at will. Cable 30cm. Nylon braided wire body and aluminum alloy interface are not easy to be damaged, more flexible and stable to use, and have a longer life. 【Safe and Portable】High-quality NVMe M.2 USB (light weight and durable) supports UASP, S.M.A.R.T and TRIM technology to improve the efficiency of NVMe SSD reading and writing, automatically identify errors, and ensure file data security. This hard drive case comes with a safety cap with hanging holes and a lanyard for easy portability.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ynrj-QIbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ORICO","source_asin":"B0B148ZQ6Y","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1176503","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B148ZQ6Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B148ZQ6Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
