window.products.push({"id":1176530,"name":"BITOO 2 Meter 6.6ft USB and 2RCA AUX Dash Mount Extension Cable, USB & 2RCA to USB and 3.5mm Aux Dash Mount for Car, Boat, Motorcycle and More","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ryODgF40L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Package: 2 x waterproof ring 1 x waterproof cover 1 x dust cover cap 4x screw USB 2 Meter 6.6ft 3.5mm Aux Dash Mount How about Installation It: Just drill the appropriate sized hole,slide in the 2.0 USB Extension pieces,thread on the plastic nut,and tighten. If the flush mount cable is longer than you need,you can coil it up and tape it off. Features: 1:This is a 2.0 USB extension mount cable,it will give you better feeling than the dual USB 1.0 Extension mount cable 2:This USB Panel Flush Mount Cable is designed for car, but you can use it to other applications too 3:To install this usb panel flush mount cable: Use an existing hole (Car cigarette lighter) or cut a hole in your dashboard and clip in the socket to flush mount it to your vehicle's dash One normal washer the HDMI dash panel cable comes with dust cover cap and two different sized retaining rings that you are free to use this hdmi flush mount cable to provide a permanent set of ports on the panel in a truck. Components are a stiff rubber/plastic,so are probably compatible with a damp environment as long as the electircal connectors are kept dry. The 2.0 USB & 2RCA Male to USB Cable is perfect for stereo installation on your Pioneer,cars and trucks,etc. If you're looking to add a USB & 2RCA Male to USB Cable power port or connection somewhere in your vehicle this is a very good option.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ryODgF40L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BITOO","source_asin":"B01IN3SYOY","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1176530","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IN3SYOY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IN3SYOY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
