window.products.push({"id":1176539,"name":"Foto&Tech DSLR Camera Strap Cam Neck Strap with Quick Release and Safety Tether, Adjustable Padded Shoulder Sling Strap for Women and Men, Compatible ","category":"electronics","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+aXvr1ScL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"This professional camera strap with quick release & harness tether is a great photography accessory for any cameras with a standard ¼-20 tripod socket.  The padded camera shoulder strap is compatible with all brands of DSLR. It is compatible with Canon EOS Rebel T6i T6s T5i T4i T3i T3 T2i T1i XT XTi XSi SL1, Nikon D7100 D7000 D5200 D5100 D5000 D3300 D3200 D3100 D3000 D90 D80, Fuji, Leica, Olympus, Panasonic, Pentax, Sony, etc.  The Foto&Tech Sport Extreme Strap permits optimal comfort and secure fit for active photographers and videographers.  The intelligent design of the camera quick strap fits comfortably over the shoulder and across the torso.  The camera harness for hiking includes an underarm strap that snaps into place, making it stable to keep the camera in place.  With a Specially designed shoulder pad, it distributes weight evenly to minimize fatigue.  Made with Polyester and ballistic nylon topside with an underside covered with foam padding & knitted mesh offers comfort & durability.  The material and design of the camera neck strap enables easy cleaning.  The heavy-duty photography strap will hold and keep the camera with lens steady in strenuous shoots. Slide the camera up the camera sling strap to grab the perfect shot.  Comes with a 1/4\"-20 fastener with rubber pad couples to CR-2 lobster clasp. The lanyard snap clip or hook has a smooth swivel with a positive lock to ensure the security of the camera and lens. The 304 stainless steel swivel keychain clasp bears weight up to 300KG.  Attachment method: lobster claw clasp to camera lug.  These tether strap secures camera with a backup connection between camera and strap, offers peace of mind and extra security in case the main strap attachment fails.  Content: 1x DSLR Camera Strap Black; 1x Shoulder Pad; 1x Quick Release Mounting Screw with Rubber Padding (FR-3 fastener); 1x Safety Tether; 1x 304 Stainless Steel Lanyard Hook/Clasp (CR-2)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+aXvr1ScL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Foto&Tech","source_asin":"B07MGZCB1K","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1176539","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MGZCB1K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MGZCB1K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
