window.products.push({"id":1176624,"name":"ANRAN Security Cameras Wireless Outdoor, 1080P AI Motion Detection & Color Night Vision Home Security Cameras, Two-Way Talk, Spotlight Siren Alarm, Wo","category":"electronics","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SvWIZ6jjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"1080P HD Live Video, Picture & Clear Color Night Vision: Equipped with a great HD image sensor and 1pcs of powerful spotlights, great image and video quality with 33ft visible range. You can view sharp color night vision even in poor light with this wifi security camera. Intelligent PIR Motion Detection and Instant Alerts: This outdoor wireless security camera has a built-in infrared motion detection sensor, it can clear analysis and recognition person, vehicle, pet and package. No matter whether you are at home, The AI PIR sensor will be triggered in real time once the outdoor security cameras detect motion, at the same time, the notification will be pushed to your phone via the app. Two-way Audio & Multi-user Access：The security camera wireless built-in microphone and speaker that supports real-time two-way audio, With ANRAN App you can warn off thieves, screen visitors at your door. This home security camera allows you to create several guest accounts and share the videos instantly with your families and friends. Rechargeable Wireless Camera and IP65 Waterproof: ANRAN WiFi wireless outdoor security camera is a rechargeable battery powered cordless camera. The wireless camera for home security comes with a 5200mAh battery. Using innovative low-power technology, it can work for 1-5 months, This battery camera can withstand rain allowing it to work in almost any weather. No monthly Fee & Encrypted Secure Data:This small and smart security camera wireless works without any additional storage subscription fees, Support Cloud Service(Free 7-Day Video History Cloud Storage) and SD Card Storage (SD card is not included). All stored data protected by military encryption, being kept private and safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SvWIZ6jjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ANRAN","source_asin":"B0BCWBK73G","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1176624","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCWBK73G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCWBK73G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1176625,"name":"AudioSource PSW100 100 Watt 10-inch Powered Subwoofer (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41B0WBDGKBL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description 10\" Down Firing 100 Watt RMS Powered Subwoofer Amazon.com Just the thing for your burgeoning home theater or back-room listening system, AudioSource's affordable PSW100 subwoofer pounds out 100 rock-solid watts of low-end power, bringing high-impact slam to DVDs and greater ambient detail and instrumental heft to your favorite music. A variable low-pass filter (LPF) lets you tailor the sub's output to your existing speakers. By setting the LPF high (toward 180 Hz) you can fill in the bass for bookshelf speakers that may have extremely limited bass output, while a lower setting (toward 40 Hz) will supplement and perceptually deepen the output from larger, floorstanding speakers that have more of their own low end to start with. You're getting more than just the basics here: the PSW100 comes with a phase-reverse switch for placement flexibility (to help align the crests and dips of the different sound waves when the PSW100 and your main speakers are in different places) and auto-on signal sensing for power conservation. You can hook up the PSW100 one of 2 ways. In the first case, you can feed the sub an RCA-tipped line-level signal from your preamplifier or surround receiver. Using this method, your receiver can most effectively route the LFE (low-frequency effects) channel from Dolby Digital, DTS, DVD-Audio, or SACD surround programs directly to your subwoofer. Alternately, you can run speaker cable from your receiver to the PSW100 and then from the sub's outputs to your front left/right speakers. Use of this method results in a more seamless transition from the subwoofer to your speakers since the signal arriving at your speakers has already been filtered through the PSW100's internal crossover (the variable LPF discussed above). If you plan to listen to stereo music with your subwoofer, this might be the way to go. What's in the Box Subwoofer, 4 screw-in wooden feet, and a user's manual.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41B0WBDGKBL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Audiosource","source_asin":"B0000YQNYI","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1176625","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000YQNYI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000YQNYI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
