window.products.push({"id":1176636,"name":"Cat6 Outdoor Ethernet Cable 25 Feet, Cat 6 Heavy Duty Internet Cord, Waterproof, Direct Burial, in Wall, POE, Network, Indoor, PVC & LLDPE UV Double J","category":"electronics","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jAaxd9geL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIGH SPEED DATA TRANSMISSION: Lag-free data transfer speeds of up to 10Gpbs (Depending on the length) and Bandwidth of up to 550MHz. 4 pairs of unshielded twisted pairs are wrapped with HDPE Insulation and separated by cross-isolation splines to avoid signal interference. Backwards compatible with Cat 5 and Cat 5e. DOUBLE JACKET: Our cat6 outdoor/indoor cable features UV Resistant LLDPE weather jacket and PVC inner jacket to provide double-layer protection to achieve the effects of high temperature resistance, Moisture proof and cold resistance. This Cat6 internet cable has a long service life and suitable for installation in wall, underground and directly buried. HIGH-QUALITY CONTROL: Our cables features 8/24AWG copper clad aluminum (CCA) solid conductors with RJ45 connectors and gold-plated contacts to optimized signal quality. Snagless cable boot provides strain relief and protects the connector. The Included 25 pcs cable ties help keep this cat 6 cable in an organized manner, no tangling worries and effectively prolong the service life. WIDE APPLICABILITY: Conable ethernet LAN cat6 cables come in length from 25 feet to 300 feet. Our cat6 ethernet patch cable suitable for outdoor, home, office and server. It is compatible with routers, switches, printers, laptops, computers, POE cameras, gaming consoles, modems, scanners, televisions, POE VoIP Phones, network switches, etc. RELIABLE SERVICE: We hope this product can create a perfect experience for you and offer a one-year warranty for this cable. If you have any questions about our products, you can contact us at any time, and our customer service will reply within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jAaxd9geL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Conable","source_asin":"B0BRT29GBX","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1176636","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRT29GBX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRT29GBX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
