window.products.push({"id":1176685,"name":"7dBi LoRa Gateway Antenna 900-930MHz Omni-Directional Pole/Wall Mount Fiberglass LoRaWan Antenna for Helium Hotspot HNT Miner + 3.3ft N-Female to SMA-","category":"electronics","retail price":39.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51auhzk3smS._AC_SL1400_.jpg","description":"Fibreglass LoRa antenna with gain of 7dBi, frequency range 902-930MHz and 92cm length. Features: For some applications like in an urban environment or where large stretches of land have to be monitored the normal range of LoRa might not be enough. If you need to increase the range for your LoRa devices, then this outdoor LoRa Fiberglass antenna will be the ideal addition to your LoRa system.  It’s a robust solution to provide extra power and range for outdoor LoRa Base stations. The antenna has an average gain of 7dBi, a length of 92cm, and a frequency range from 902-930MHz and it comes with hardware for pole and wall mounting. The Antenna has an N-J Double tooth connector, and it comes with an N-Female to RP-SMA plug cable so it can be easily connected to the SenseCAP Gateways. Application The antenna can be used in any environment where long-range LoRa connections are required. Agriculture Environmental Monitoring Urban Monitoring Parameters: Frequency: 900-930MHz Antenna Gain: 7.0 +/-0.8dBi Efficiency>=60% Radiation Pattern:Omni-Directional Max Input Power>=2W Polarization:Linear polarization/ Vertical Impedance :50 Ohm Material of Radiator: CU Material of Plastic: FRP (white light) Cable Type :RG-141 50Ohm Connector Type:N-J Double tooth connector Antenna Color Storage life< 2 year Cable length:1m","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51auhzk3smS._AC_SL1400_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"seeed studio","source_asin":"B099J2XQCP","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1176685","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099J2XQCP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B099J2XQCP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
