window.products.push({"id":1176747,"name":"Samsung Series 7 DP700A3D-A01US 23-Inch All-in-One Touchscreen Desktop","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bTdidJ3UL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Simply put, Samsung Series 7 All-In-One PCs are absolutely beautiful. An elegant aesthetic and brilliant HD displays featuring touch screen technology garner ultimate style points for your home or office. And once you finally get beyond the cutting-edge design, you’ll discover a PC that offers everything you demand. From emails to multimedia presentations to Web browsing and more, Series 7 All-In-One PCs truly live up to their name. The Series 7 All-In-One with 23.6-inch Full HD 1080p touchscreen display ( view larger ). Gesture Control for a whole new PC experience ( view larger ). DP700A3D-A01USSeries 7 All-In-OneAt a Glance: 23.6-inch Full HD 1080p touch-enabled display 23.6-inch Full HD 1080p touch-enabled display 2.9 GHz Intel Core  i5-3470T processor 2.9 GHz Intel Core  i5-3470T processor 1 TB SATA2 hard drive 1 TB SATA2 hard drive 6 GB installed RAM 6 GB installed RAM Integrated Intel HD Graphics Integrated Intel HD Graphics DVD±RW Super Multi dual-layer drive DVD±RW Super Multi dual-layer drive Wireless-N Wi-Fi + Bluetooth Wireless-N Wi-Fi + Bluetooth HDMI input and output HDMI input and output See full specs below See full specs below Explore your favorite apps, websites and more with touch screen and gesture control technology. Access the Web, type and send emails, chat with friends and more with the simple touch of the screen. 23.6-Inch High Definition Touch Screen The 23.6-inch multi-touch screen has a viewing angle up to 178˚ and can detect up to 10 pressure points for a seamless and more efficient user experience. Gesture Control Use gesture control to adjust the volume of your device from across the room , play games and even control the cursor without touching the device Elegant and beautiful touchscreen ( view larger ). Share apps and content across devices with the touch of a finger Now you can connect your Series 7 All-In-One PC with multiple compatible devices via the Internet. Download content from a Samsung Smart TV, smart phone or camera running AllShare™ technology. Stream music, movies and photos from your Series 7 All-In-one PC to your Smart TV. Customizable User Settings Be even more productive with user settings designed with you in mind. The most commonly used features are designed to be fast and simple to use. And you have complete control over it all. Change networks in the blink of an eye and customize sound and vision with a simple touch of the screen. Adjust power settings to improve productivity without sacrificing performance. Switch from touch screen interaction to a traditional PC experience with the included wireless keyboard and mouse. Discover the New, Beautiful, Fast and Fluid Windows 8 Reimagined to be all about you, Windows 8 lets you personalize your desktop and gives you instant access to all your favorite people, apps, sites and more. Use S Manager to keep your PC running smoothly with the latest software and drivers, and to download Samsung’s Quick Starter feature, which adds a toolbar and start button for easy navigation. Plus, connect to SkyDrive® and store files, photos, videos and more, so wherever you go, you’re connected to the cloud. Wireless Keyboard and Mouse In keeping with the Series 7 AIO's simple and elegant design, the included keyboard and mouse are wireless. Key Specifications 23.6-inch LED-backlit, touchscreen display with 1920 x 1080-pixel resolution for native Full HD 1080p viewing 2.9 GHz Intel Core i5-3470T dual-core processor (3 MB L3 cache) 1 TB SATA2 hard drive (5400 RPM) 6 GB of installed DDR3 RAM (8 GB maximum) Integrated Intel HD Graphics 4000 for casual and mainstream gaming (supports Microsoft DirectX 10) DVD±RW Super Multi Dual Layer (S-ATA) Drive 1.0-megapixel HD webcam Built-in stereo speakers (14 watts total; 7W x 2) Dimensions and Weight: 22.6\" x 7\" x 17.3 inches (WxDxH); 18.74 pounds Wireless & Networking Next-generation Bluetooth 4.0 HS connectivity Next-generation Bluetooth 4.0 HS connectivity Gigabit LAN Wired Ethernet Gigabit LAN Wired Ethernet Connectivity & Expansion 1 ultra-fast rechargeable USB 3.0 port 1 ultra-fast rechargeable USB 3.0 port 1 ultra-fast USB 3.0 port 1 ultra-fast USB 3.0 port 3 standard USB 2.0 ports 3 standard USB 2.0 ports 2 HDMI ports with one input and one output 2 HDMI ports with one input and one output 3-in-1 (SD/SDHC/SDXC) 3-in-1 (SD/SDHC/SDXC) RJ45 RJ45 Microphone and headphone jacks Microphone and headphone jacks What's in the Box Series 7 All-In-One (model DP700A3D-A01US), 90 W AC Adapter, wireless keyboard, wireless mouse, batteries for peripherals, operating instructions Warranty 1-year limited warranty on parts and labor. See a larger image with more views of all the Series 7 AIO's ports. Amazon.com","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51bTdidJ3UL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SAMSUNG","source_asin":"B0098NTF8S","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1176747","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0098NTF8S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0098NTF8S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
