window.products.push({"id":1176752,"name":"GYMROAD Smart Watch with Receive & Dial, Fitness Tracker Waterproof Smartwatch for Android iOS Phones 1.32\" HD Full Touch Screen Digital Watches with ","category":"electronics","retail price":38.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VbloJtB1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Buletooth Dial/Receive Calls and Smart Notification: Gymroad smart watch built-in high-quality speakers, After connecting to Bluetooth, you can making or receiving phonecalls, Bluetooth 5.0 (supports Android 6.0+, IOS9.0+ above), Also you can receive SMS and APP messages (Text, Facebook, WhatsApp, Instagram, Twitter...) , you won't miss any important information, Free your hands when you are in fitness swimming cycling and running. Track your health at all times：The fitness watch records daily steps, distance, calorie consumption. It can track and analyse Sleep time and heart rate, also monitor blood oxygen, and sleep, pays attention to your health at all times, records physical changes, and helps you better understand your health. Activity tracker fitness watch and Life assistant: This step counter watch supports 20types of fitness trackers, such as Walking, Running, Cycling, Skipping, Badminton, Basketball, and Football. Recording your steps, distance, calories, etc activity data. It can also work as an assistant: music and camera control, weather display, sedentary reminder, drink water reminder, alarm clock, stopwatch, find phone, which help you live a convenient life. Great Battery Life & IP68 Waterproof Smart Watch: When fully-charged, this watch can last for up to5~ 7 days or 20 days standby time. With IP68 waterproof, this fitness watch can meet the waterproof requirements of your daily activities such as washing hands or working out in the rain with it. 1.32 Inch Full-touch Screen & Custom Watch Face: The watch with 1.32 inch LCD screen can provide you with high-quality touch and visual experience. Five levels of brightness options allow you to easily read information in the sun or dark. Also you can choose a picture you like to customize the watch face in Movwing App.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VbloJtB1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GYMROAD","source_asin":"B0BVTGVS3M","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1176752","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BVTGVS3M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BVTGVS3M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1176753,"name":"Lexmark X8350 Color All-in-One Plus Photo Features with USB Cable","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41C4YPF7NYL._AC_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer The Lexmark X8350 offers small businesses a practical means of combining necessary office functions into one convenient machine. The unit allows you to print at business class speeds: Up to 19 ppm color and up to 25 ppm black. You can produce brilliant six-color borderless photos at up to 4,800 dpi on photo paper, with an optional color photo print cartridge (available separately). The X8350 provides full photo capability with PC-free printing from memory cards, PictBridge direct connection cameras or USB Flash drives. By tapping a few buttons, you can create photo enhancements like cropping, red eye removal and color fix. Easily preview and edit your images using the 2.36\" (60mm) color screen on the control panel. With the 48-bit flatbed color scanner, you can easily scan documents or photos at sizes up to 8.5\" x 14\". A convenient fax machine includes a 50-page automatic document feeder and 33.6 Kbps modem, along with 89 speed dials and 10 groups with 30 numbers per group, five quick-dial buttons, Caller ID and distinctive ring detection (with subscription to local service). The X8350 thermal inkjet colors are clear and accurate, so your documents will always be sharply legible. This Windows-compatible unit earns an Energy Star rating, and includes a two-meter USB cable, along with a one-year limited warranty. What's in the Box: X8350 unit, power cable, USB cable, software bundle with drivers, utilities, Lexmark Photo Editor and Imaging Studio, black ink cartridge, tricolor ink cartridge, printed user's guide, warranty and registration card","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41C4YPF7NYL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lexmark","source_asin":"B000CDWNS2","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1176753","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000CDWNS2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B000CDWNS2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
