window.products.push({"id":1176823,"name":"Digital Juice Suction Mount Series Ball Head 3 Pak Bundle","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61F-SAvd8QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For use with cameras under 13 pounds, the Digital Juice Gear Suction Mount Series Ball Head allows for quick camera setup and adjustment when shooting in difficult situations. It lets you position your camera at a variety of angles when mounted to any flat, non-porous surface using the integrated suction cup mount. This unit is a perfect tool for rigging small cameras in hard to reach areas for car shoots, tight office environments or other awkward locations, without the need for a bulky tripod. The ball head unit provides full support for a pro SLR camera or medium format system. The ball locks down with one central twist lock, and the camera attaches to the quick release system, which provides a sliding camera plate (3.5 x 2.2 x 0.6\"). The quick release plate base has two bubble levels for leveling on two planes, and the plate comes supplied with removable 1/4\"-20 and 3/8\" camera screws, as well as a spring loaded video pin. At the bottom end of the unit, the ball head is permanently affixed to a 4.75\" suction cup mount, ideal for use on non-porous smooth surfaces such as windows, walls or a car hood when shooting on location or in tight spots. Attaching the suction cup mount to a smooth surface is very easy. Just place the suction cup where you need it and then pump the white pin until the red line on it is no longer visible. The unit will be firmly attached and ready to receive any compatible camera.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61F-SAvd8QL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Digital Juice","source_asin":"B077ZN8RPM","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1176823","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B077ZN8RPM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B077ZN8RPM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
