window.products.push({"id":1176825,"name":"OBA-HORSE Universal Multi Battery Charger for Your Disposable Alkaline AA,AAA,C,D,9V Batteries, and Ni-Cd, Ni-Mh, Lithium 18650, 26650 Batteries, 2 US","category":"electronics","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hBtQKJGZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Universal Rapid Charger is a device equipped with the best available technology. It charges AA, AAA, C, D , ,9V,18650 Li-ion ( lithium ) NiMH (Nickel Metal Hydride), NiCD (Nickel Cadmium), RAM (Rechargeable Alkaline Manganese) and even Alkaline batteries which is previously non-rechargeable.two USB ports 5V 1A output , It is Built-In RISC architecture with a 8 bit microprocessor to intelligently monitor and control the charging cycle in each charging port for overcharge and short-circuit protections. It is also built with the latest battery charging technologyThe newest Technilogy (ACC and ATC) charged when needed minimizing charging current to control the batteries will not over heat during charge \"Negative Delta V\" detect the NiMH and NiCD batteries when fully charged on the peak level batteries capacity cut off ,, a constant current trickle charge will keep the battery at optimum This charger meets the current requirements of European and National guidelines. It is an excellent choice for providing a comprehensive and versatile solution to keeping batteries charged when needed and minimizing battery waste. Features: It charges AA, AAA, C, D, N, 9V, NiMH, NiCD, RAM and even Alkaline batteries. With LCD and 8 bit microprocessor, it employs advanced RISC architecture with integrated converters and multi-channels high speed input/output ports to control the whole charge in real time. It can charge up to 5 batteries with one 9V battery at a time and recharges batteries in SINGLE or Group as the microprocessor monitors each charging bay individually. Individual timers aid in overcharge protection, giving a complete intelligently controlled charging cycle. It is Built-In with \"Negative Delta V\" cut-off function and short-circuit protection..UL safety approve certificate for USA","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hBtQKJGZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OBA-HORSE","source_asin":"B079DNBMQY","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1176825","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079DNBMQY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B079DNBMQY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
