window.products.push({"id":1176907,"name":"Panasonic K-KJ87KHA4BA Individual Battery Charger with Portable Charging Technology and 4AA eneloop pro Rechargeable Batteries, Black","category":"electronics","retail price":35.05,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xGYNkfV5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"eneloop pro AA and AAA NiMH ready to use rechargeable batteries utilize Panasonic advanced rechargeable battery technology, allowing them to be recharged up to 500 times. eneloop pro AA and AAA rechargeable batteries deliver consistent power performance, maintain 85% of their charge for up to 1 year (when not in use and stored properly), come pre-charged by solar power (at the factory) and are ready to use out of the package. These eneloop pro batteries also feature extreme temperature performance down to -4 deg F. Pair eneloop pro and eneloop AA and AAA batteries with Panasonic advanced, quick advanced, or super quick advance eneloop pro chargers to maximize your rechargeable battery experience. The Panasonic CC87, 4-position Ni-MH battery charger can quickly, and individually charge any combination of up to four AA or AAA eneloop pro batteries; charging time 4AA (6hrs.), 4AAA (4.5hrs.), 2AA (3hrs.), and 2AAA (2.5hrs.) individual charging means you can easily and efficiently charge from 1 to 4 batteries with differing levels of remaining charge. A huge time saver! The CC87 features a USB DC 5V output, which uses the stored battery power to charge mobile phones and other devices. Alkaline batteries can be used in the mobile charging mode to power other devices. However, alkaline batteries cannot be charged in the CC87. This charger also features 4 individual LED charge indicator lights. Once batteries are installed, the charger measures each cell and the corresponding light indicates the remaining charge; Green 80-100%, Orange 20%=80%, and Red 0%-20%. after each battery reaches the next level of charging the LED light changes to indicate the cells charge level. When the battery is completely charged, the LED light turns off for that cell. Ideal for use at home, in the office, or on the road, this Panasonic CC87 charger is a quick and convenient way to recharge any combination of up to four AA or AAA Ni-MH eneloop, eneloop pro, or conventional Panasonic Ni-MH rechargeable batteries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51xGYNkfV5L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"eneloop","source_asin":"B0C2VGD7GR","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1176907","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C2VGD7GR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C2VGD7GR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
