window.products.push({"id":1176914,"name":"MyCableMart 8ft Elite Toslink Digital Optical Audio Cable (SPDI/F), Metal Connectors","category":"electronics","retail price":17.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512Q0v9vBVL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"Toslink is a connector format for fiber optic digital audio cables. A fiber optic digital audio cable carries audio data in the form of light impulses instead of electrical signals. The Toslink connector is a square plug and is used with newer Dolby Digital surround sound receivers, digital versatile discs (DVDs), and compact disk (CD) players, satellite dish receivers, and other devices. Connects any stereo or home theater system with Toslink digital audio port. Works with digital receivers, CD/DVD, MiniDisc players/recorders, or any other digital audio device with optical connectors. Toslink optical cables are the defacto standard for most stereos, home-theatres, TVs, Blue Ray, DVD/CD players, digital receivers, and satellite receivers. Product Features* GOLD-PLATED Polished Metal ConnectorsPrevents Corrosion and Provides for Maximum Protection of the Fiber Tip* HEAVY 6.0mm JACKET Helps Prevent Cable Damage and Provides Additional Strain Relief * Outer Cable Diameter: 6.0mm* Maximum Connector Outer Diameter: 13.3mm* Connector Length (Shell portion): 33.2mm* NYLON Braided Sleeve Jacket * Suitable for in-wall installation* TL1-5 Toslink Standard End Connectors* RoHS Compliant (Lead Free)* PRECISION POLISHED FIBER TIPS for Maximum Signal Transfer (includes tip protectors)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/512Q0v9vBVL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"My Cable Mart","source_asin":"B00T865X0Y","category_path":"Electronics"},"sku":"BM-1176914","productType":"Electronics","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00T865X0Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"electronics-range.jsonl","source_asin":"B00T865X0Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
